    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2c62534aac724069f98271",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太好了，我一直想向阁下讨教一二。\r\n如今殿下已取得相当傲人的战绩，\r\n敢问阁下今后将与殿下一同向什么路线进军？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9397fafc3b4f155271b00e54f05ed16785b61fef93248ee53d71be07e62898f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
