    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e719f114e813d87d6cccdeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可算是硬着头皮撑过来了……\r\n在对话告一段落后，我总算是有了脱身的机会，\r\n与美妙姿势一同来到一旁稍事休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a716389aa1e594914eaf559c2b5b38194afa72de6c2a93e64e99b9a3e66023d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
